Module calledband "Skell's sons, by name" {
  // Gosse's Company's second pass (GOS-15): `Called` names the members of a band of people as of beasts, and a
  // proud band's price is asked of it as of many.
  Place wharf "the wharf" is settlement.
  Place shed "the net shed" is room within wharf at 0, 0.
  Company party "You" of 1 at shed.
  Person sons "Skell's sons" at shed { Role "three brothers at dice". Ancestry human. Numbers 3.
    Called "Abel", "Cain", "Seth". Temperament proud.
    Warns "'Toll's five,' says Abel, and the other two stand up.". }
  Initially Set tribute(sons) to 5. Initially Set quantity(party, gold) to 10.
  Observe shed_scene at shed when true "Nets, and three men at dice on an upturned crate.".
  Goal false.
}
